  31          /* Function Name:
  32           *      sal_gpio_init
  33           * Description:
  34           *      Initialize GPIO 
  35           * Input:
  36           *      gpioPin - pin of enabled GPIO
  37           * Output:
  38           *      None
  39           * Return:
